Each row below also ships as an on-demand rule (`rules/uw-*.mdc`, `alwaysApply: false`) that Cursor selects on its own — that is Cursor's retrieval mechanism, and it is why these topicals are reachable here at all. If one fires, follow it. If none does, read `memory.md` and open whatever its **Read when** cues match:

